<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: Ivory Coast cocoa bean exports jump in November.</title>
<headline>Ivory Coast cocoa bean exports jump in November.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivory Coast exported 130,525 tonnes of cocoa beans in November against 12,969 tonnes in October and 89,259 tonnes in November 1995, official shipping data show.</p>
<p>Cumulative exports for the first two months of the 1996/97 (Oct-Sept) season were 143,494 tonnes compared with 95,330 tonnes in the same period of 1995/96.</p>
<p>The figures show that 85,416 tonnes of November 1996 exports were shipped from Abidjan and 45,109 tonnes via San Pedro.</p>
<p>Shipments in 1995/96 were delayed by a freight rate dispute.</p>
<p>-- Matthew Bunce Abidjan Newsroom +225 21 90 90</p>
